  No new full Debug run is claimed.
  Current execution work retains fixture executable bytes across processes through the existing
  ProgramBinaryStore, under each configuration's ignored test output directory. No test rows,
  native-owner isolation, assertions or explicit cold/isolated cache policies are removed.
  The empty-cache Release seed passes 5,946 with six skips; the fresh-process warm run passes
  5,945 with seven skips, both zero failures across all 5,952 runtime identities. Command walls
  are 681.007s / 641.200s, excluding builds. The routine five-minute target remains unmet.
  All 434 persisted binaries (17,523,863 bytes) retain their hashes and modification times,
  while index recency advances; no entries are added, rewritten or evicted in the warm run.
  Explicit uncached mechanics and isolated cache-policy checks remain passing. Bounded warmed
  attribution isolates seconds of first-use draw-wrapper/pass-completion work in two numerical
  water cases; immediate repeats on the same program complete in milliseconds. This does not
  identify an exclusive GPU/driver cause or establish a full-suite improvement. On 2026-11-04 the
